{\qc
2: Chapter 2: Past Days at the Ranch\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {\s3 \afs28
{\b
{\qc
 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although D had a rough guess about the effects of the "Golden Finger," due to some real-world reasons, he couldn't attempt to use it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
First, he didn't have any Pokemon around him, and secondly, the original owner was just too poor...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At three in the morning, D, having barely filled his stomach, began pondering his current predicament.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For him, traversing into this world was indeed a joyful event, but regardless of which world it was, or whatever he wanted to do, he needed to fill his stomach first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D cleaned the dishes and then sat at the desk to sort out the original owner's belongings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As a wanderer away from home, the original owner's backpack was very simple.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Apart from a few changes of clothes, there were just three packs of instant noodles and a pile of scattered coins and notes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D counted, the total amount was around 2300.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This amount of money wouldn't last him a travel journey; he'd likely starve to death in less than a month.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After doing some mental calculations about the conversion of this world's prices, D couldn't help but sigh into his hands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sigh, it was too difficult for him...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But thinking of the cute and majestic Pokemon in anime, D revived his spirits and lifted himself up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Take it step by step!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Maybe from not having a good rest before traveling or due to this body being overly exhausted, after filling his stomach, D quickly felt an overwhelming drowsiness come upon him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He did not resist, thinking he could finally have a good sleep, not needing to worry about being late for work tomorrow, nor having to skimp and save to repay the mortgage. Tomorrow would be a new day.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Turning off the light and lying on the wooden bed, D soon fell into a deep sleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Early the next morning, he was awakened by a knocking sound at the door.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D opened his eyes abruptly, sitting up in tension, and upon observing his surroundings, he suddenly realized the fact that he had already crossed over to another world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He breathed a sigh of relief, with the knocking sound outside continuing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D was a bit puzzled, got out of bed with messy hair, opened the door, and saw an elderly man wearing a brown vest, slightly pudgy, with a black gentleman's hat standing outside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The elderly man appeared to be between sixty and seventy years old; seeing him come out, he displayed a warm and kind smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beside him stood a creature that stood on two feet, resembling a lizard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The creature was green, shiny, with a smooth sheen under the Morning Sun, a tire-like structure around its neck, and a sturdy, dark green resilient tail gently swaying behind it, with the tip of the tail a translucent white.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It opened its big eyes, curiously examining him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D was instantly drawn to it and recognized this Pokemon immediately \u8212? Cyclizar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And the elderly man before him was the mayor of Porto Marinada Town.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The old man spoke, "I heard yesterday you said you plan to stay and manage this ranch, and I thought you might be unfamiliar with ranch work, moreover, cleaning alone can be tiring, so I brought this child over."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D was slightly taken aback; after a moment's recollection, a memory surfaced in his mind:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yesterday morning, when the original owner returned to the ranch, he happened to encounter the old mayor, who recognized him and after some niceties, said:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Here is the inheritance your grandfather left you. I knew one day you would return, so I come by periodically to help clean it. Although it has been abandoned for many years, the house is still livable. Feel free to stay here!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The original owner decently thanked him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The old mayor showed a smile, "When I was young, I was friends with your grandfather. When you were little, I held you! It's something your grandfather entrusted me with before he passed! I must hand over the ranch to you!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212? The old mayor apparently thought the original owner returned to take care of the ranch, D thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Realizing this, D instantly understood the situation, but looking at this Cyclizar, he was still a bit puzzled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the tall and lanky youth before him, the old mayor couldn't help but feel a bit of sympathy and regret.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such a pitiful child! All his family has passed away, leaving him alone in this world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After seeing his state yesterday, the old mayor went home and brought over the child of his own Cyclizar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One reason was for Cyclizar to stay by his side so they'd have company, and secondly, Cyclizar could also help along with the ranch work.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The old mayor sighed in his heart, but outwardly, he gently asked, "Can you help me take care of it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As an adult, he immediately understood what the old mayor meant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D looked at Cyclizar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cyclizar also gazed back with wide eyes, innocent and curious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cyclizar, a Pokemon of Normal and Dragon Type, has lived alongside households in the Paldea Region since ancient times.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They're gentle by nature and, due to their aversion to cold, can use human body heat to warm their backs, allowing humans to ride on their backs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Therefore, in this particular region of Paldea, Cyclizar also serves as a mode of transportation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D couldn't think of a reason to refuse because he wanted to have his own Pokemon as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Receiving a starter Pokemon from the local professor, like Ash in the anime, to travel together seemed impossible.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He didn't have any Poke Balls on him, and it was even less possible to capture wild Pokemon with just his fists and feet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
