The only time it took the initiative was when the alien Pok\u233?mon Deoxys descended on this planet, but it didn't manage to prevent it...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It's just unknown if there's only one Rayquaza in this world, Dragonite had seen a black one before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While pondering, the Paldea Giant Pit had already disappeared far behind them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D looked back but saw nothing, just a vast blue sky with floating white clouds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking at this beautiful scenery, D swept away the gloom left by the Paradox Pok\u233?mon and couldn't help but feel happy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Coincidentally, there was a flock of migrating Kilowattrel flying ahead, and D greeted them happily: "Good morning, Kilowattrel!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Kilowattrel were startled, turning to look at this strange human.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some Kilowattrel couldn't brake in time and crashed straight into companions flying ahead, prompting an angry growl from the hit Kilowattrel who pecked the offender's head hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching this scene, D chuckled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Indeed, this is the Pok\u233?mon World he knows!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Be careful flying high up! Bye-bye!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D waved at the flock of Kilowattrel and continued the journey with Koraidon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before noon, the familiar Porto Marinada Town finally appeared below.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking at the vast fields on the ground, D couldn't help but anticipate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Soon, Koraidon landed in the pasture.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D jumped off it and, looking around at all the familiar things, couldn't help but sigh: "There's no place like home!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before he could turn around, he heard an excited "Mama".\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D turned back and saw a large group of Pok\u233?mon excitedly running towards him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching this scene, he couldn't help but grin, stepping forward to touch this one and kiss that one, then announced: "Everyone, we're back!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing the commotion, Cyclizar also ran out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It looked at the pumpkins in the field yet to mature, then at D in front, and was instantly dumbfounded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D is back? But the pumpkins aren't mature yet? Could it be that Cyclizar is so longing that it's hallucinating?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cyclizar rubbed its eyes incredulously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It opened its eyes, and D did not disappear, instead walking toward it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cyclizar had a dumbfounded face: "Gao?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
