{\qc
 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After calming the group of Pokemon that gathered around, D returned to the house with his bag in hand, and sat on the sofa, letting out a deep sigh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing D return, the Indeedee Sibling felt very happy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sister Indeedee placed a cup of tea in front of D, then turned and took two photos from the table.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D raised his eyebrow slightly, looking at the small claw prints on the back of the photos; it was obvious who sent them back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He reached out to take the photos, casually asking, "When were these sent back?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sister Indeedee gestured a three and a one: "Ai-ai."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D understood, one photo was sent three days ago, and the other one day ago.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This time, what kind of photos would they be?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D flipped through the two photos with interest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the first photo, he saw a vast, boundless ocean; above the sea was a blue sky dotted with fluffy white clouds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the middle of the photo were Mew and Teddiursa, their faces looking troubled, seemingly vexed about not finding land to stand on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing this, D was quite surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He remembered the last time these two Pokemon sent a letter, they were over in the Orange Archipelago.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They should have yet to leave the vicinity of the Orange Archipelago these days.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although D had never been to the Orange Archipelago, he could imagine the landscape and environment there.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everywhere is boundless ocean, with scattered islands forming the Orange Archipelago.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clearly, Teddiursa and Mew were lost, and from their expressions, they hadn't found an island to rest on for quite some time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Two poor little guys..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D's heart was eager to know what happened next, so he continued to look at the second photo.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The backdrop of the photo was still a vast ocean.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Mew and Teddiursa's location had shifted from the air to the sea surface.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They were standing on the back of a Lapras, riding it across the sea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And in front of Lapras, appeared a lush green island.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Perhaps they finally found a resting spot, as both Mew and Teddiursa wore excited smiles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whatever they might have communicated to the Lapras, it also turned its head, looking warmly and amicably towards the camera.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D couldn't help but breathe a sigh of relief, happy for Mew and Teddiursa finding an island.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To say the least, they really have that adventurous and traveling spirit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking at the friendly Pokemon in the photo, D murmured, "Lapras... this type of Pokemon is really rare!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lapras, also known as Lapras, possesses a gentle heart, enjoys carrying humans across the sea, and once nearly became extinct due to illegal human poaching.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, that seems to have been a long time ago.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Currently, major Pokemon Leagues list Lapras as a key protected species, especially in Alola Region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It's said that because of excessive protection, Lapras there has become somewhat overpopulated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unfortunately, drought can kill, while floods can drown.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lapras are hard to see in the Paldea Region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
*\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back at the ranch, D's life returned to how it was before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Every day he farmed the fields, basked in the sun, drank tea, and petted Pokemon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The group of wild Pokemon he helped and raised in the Berry Garden gradually emerged from their initial shadows and adapted to their current life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This morning, D took them to the back mountain to see what had become of the place they once lived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As soon as they entered the back mountain, they saw a very unfamiliar scene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The forest, ravaged by fire, was all in disarray; burn marks were everywhere, thick layers of ash remained on the ground, the scorched, barren trees appeared like an eerie, horrifying black forest, devoid of vitality.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Wattrel, its wings fully recovered, flapped its wings and landed on a dead branch, lowering its head and sorrowfully viewing the scene below.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Greedent, its tail fur regrown, swiftly climbed a tree, jumping back and forth on several sturdy trees, as if searching for something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Petilil and several Shroomish looked sorrowful; they still remembered how vibrant and green this place used to be, covered with grass and towering trees.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The other Pokemon also looked downcast, appearing quite sad.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing this, D sighed and said, "You know, these plant ashes contain a wealth of nutrients and trace elements that plants need."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A group of Pokemon stared over in bewilderment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D: "These ashes will make the soil more fertile, as all plant life turns into earth nutrients, rejoining the natural cycle."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Come next year, they will grow anew, becoming even more lush than before."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Deadwood shall eventually sprout new shoots; this forest awaits rebirth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this moment, the Kricketune among the group of Pokemon seemed to have understood D's meaning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It swung its forearms like an inspired musician, producing a melodious, unusual tune from its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The melody initially sounded sorrowful and downbeat, but soon it surged like waves, becoming filled with enthusiasm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D was slightly startled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The other Pokemon, seemingly encouraged, no longer appeared downcast, their eyes turning resolute.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
