Clearly, it enjoyed the taste of the red tea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Polteageist looked at the red tea before it, unsure of what it was thinking, and after a while, let out a soft sigh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D: "?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just then, two little heads peeked out from under the table.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pawmot and Alcremie looked innocently towards Polteageist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alcremie happily said, "Maa maa!" (The tea D brewed is delicious! Sweet!)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pawmot nodded in agreement: "Bamo bamo!" (That's right, go ahead and try it!)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
