{\b
{\qc
 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Early the next morning, D began organizing the Pokemon on the ranch for a morning run and workout.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even the calm Dolliv was forcibly dragged along, starting from the doorstep, passing by the Glass Greenhouse and Berry Garden, and running around the edges of the ranch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Faced with D's sudden raid, the group of Pokemon were both bewildered and confused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Koraidon, Cyclizar, Pawmot, Gogoat, and Dragonite, who were already skilled at running, found it quite easy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whereas for Alcremie, Glaceon, Dolliv, Miltank, and Naclstack, who didn't get much exercise daily, it was somewhat torturous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Miltank was so tired it was gasping for breath, eventually resorting to Rollout.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It curled its body into a ball and rolled quickly around the ranch, swiftly moving from the back of the group to a forward position.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the horse stable, Spectrier and Glastrier watched the lively race while munching on carrots.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After one lap, Alcremie was exhausted and collapsed on the grass, with a very aggrieved look on its face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mamaa..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D stood in front of the group of Pokemon and finally explained in response to their queries:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Everyone must be wondering why I made you start exercising today, right?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roar." Dragonite nodded its big head; it didn't mind working out, it was just quite surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's because I heard that the stronger and healthier a Pokemon's body is, the more powerful it is, and the longer it can live in this world." D explained.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Live longer?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon hearing this, Dragonite and the other Pokemon blinked, showing expressions of puzzlement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To be honest, they didn't have much concept of lifespan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The group of Pokemon looked at D puzzled, so D had to explain the specific meaning of lifespan:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lifespan is the time we can spend in this world. Most organisms have limited lifespans, but due to different races, there can be differences in length."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this point, D intended to explain a deeper meaning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But he thought again, the Pokemon didn't need to know these things; even if they knew, it'd only increase their sadness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, he changed his words: "Once our bodies get stronger, we can keep living together."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon hearing this, the group of Pokemon blinked as if they understood it, though many parts of it were confusing, they understood the last sentence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As long as they grow stronger, they can be with D forever!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D's gaze swept across the Pokemon in front of him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Each Pokemon's expression was different; some looked blank, clearly not understanding.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While others had clear eyes, indicating they understood his words.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Like the Indeedee Sibling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D nodded at them, all was understood without words.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this point, the clever Pawmot asked, "Bamor?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Translation Nuts Cake at home had been used up, so D couldn't directly understand the Pokemon's meaning now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing this, Pawmot looked around, then quickly ran to the Glass Greenhouse to bring out Calyrex.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Calyrex's translation, D finally understood Pawmot's question.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was asking, "How long is D's lifespan?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D was slightly startled, then replied with a smile, "Me? I'll live to be a hundred!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the Pokemon unable to understand, D explained, "It means living to more than a hundred years old."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pawmot persisted, "Bamor?" (What happens after a hundred?)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D thought carefully, then said, "In human terms, it would be passing away! Passing away means dying, leaving this world."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon hearing this, the group of Pokemon in front of him suddenly showed sad expressions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They knew what dying meant; they'd seen Pokemon lose their lives in a fire before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dying means never being able to open your eyes to speak again, forever buried in the soil.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But no need to worry." D said with a smile: "Even if I pass away, it doesn't matter; I'll become a ghost and accompany you, always be with you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, in this world ghosts do exist. If Dusknoir, the gatekeeper of the Spirit Realm, comes to take him away, he believes everyone will protect him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By then, the World Tree should have grown, and he can happily live with the Pokemon on it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pawmot's eyes sparkled with tears, "Bamor?" (Really?)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D nodded, "Of course it's true!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon hearing this, Dragonite immediately hugged D tightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now we can train happily, right?" D pat Dragonite's big claw, asking humorously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roar!" Dragonite nodded enthusiastically.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then, you all keep running!" D took a deep breath, said with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, the Pokemon in front of him did not move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They looked at each other and then let out a series of growls that D couldn't understand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Koraidon stepped forward to grab his hand, and the other Pokemon gathered around. In the company of them, D was drawn into this workout activity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
