Hmm, the texture has become harder. In terms of enduring damage, there should be significant enhancement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Just right, I can discuss in detail the Storm Trial and Thunder Trial with Dragonite and Pawmot later. Judging by the time, Paldea Academy's students should arrive here soon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because Rika told him earlier that the Paldea League planned to broadcast the follow-up of the forest fire that shocked the region to the people living in this land today.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By then, surely many Trainers lured by Calyrex would come, and he must make preparations in advance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this moment, the Miltanks beside him were already restless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D turned to look.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Miltanks also looked at him, brimming with spirit and shouted, "Moo!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D: "...Go! Remember to take care and not bump into other Pok\u233?mon!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Moo!" The three Miltanks stretched out their strong arms and then transformed into round balls, rolling excitedly across the grass.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching this scene, D wrote in his notebook:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"After drinking Life Sheep Milk, the Miltanks seem to have overflowed energy. They're always full of vitality, exercising by rolling around."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This situation is somewhat like what happened previously when Skiddo consumed lots of Grassy Seed and disco-danced on the Grassy Terrain to expend energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only, the Miltanks' method is much straightforward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roll, roll, continuously roll without stopping.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If given more time, D thinks they might even surpass Whitney's Miltank.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He suddenly remembered Whitney's Miltank in games that often troubled players.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then the question arises, could he replicate it in the ranch?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This matter depends on the Miltanks' proficiency with Rollout in the future.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While formulating the training plan for Miltanks in his mind, D checked the changes on other Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now in the ranch, excluding Teddiursa and Mew on travel outside, there are thirty Pok\u233?mon in total residing in the ranch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
