There are also Calyrex and its two steeds, along with its official teawares Sinistea and Polteageist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, there are some Dragonite and Dragonair who came from Dragonite Island to work but won't reside in the ranch, and the Gimmighoul hiding in the tavern not coming out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This number, when calculated carefully, is quite impressive, as most people cannot remember each Pok\u233?mon's moves and preferences.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Luckily, D prepared an observation notebook long ago, dedicating it to recording the moves, dietary preferences, and physical conditions of Pok\u233?mon in the ranch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
