{\qc
 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, in the Glass Greenhouse, Calyrex, who was resting with eyes closed, suddenly opened them as if sensing something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What on earth... has happened?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How could there be so much Power of Faith?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Feeling the warm energy continuously pouring into its body, Calyrex's pupils trembled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This sudden surge of faith left it somewhat incredulous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
