{\qc
 \par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Battle him?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D suddenly found it hard to understand the intentions of these three Dragonites.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why would Dragonites specifically come from Dragonite Island just to have a battle with his Pok\u233?mon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Realizing that the intentions of these three Dragonites were not simple, D asked Pawmot to run an errand for him and bring back some Translation Nuts Cake.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pamo!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pawmot nodded and immediately turned around to fly away.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The leader Dragonite and its two underlings stood there silently with a fierce demeanor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
During the wait, no one spoke first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only Koraidon looked somewhat speechlessly at the three Dragonites.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pawmot was very quick, returning in a few seconds, bringing back the Translation Nuts Cake that D wanted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D patted its head and reached out to take the cake and eat it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After pondering for a moment, D asked, "Why do you suddenly want to battle with me?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The leader Dragonite said seriously, "Roar." (Because you are strong.)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D raised an eyebrow: "\u8230?So you want to battle stronger Pok\u233?mon?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking at this Dragonite, it definitely wasn't as gentle and docile as other Dragonites. It must have been through many battles to become like this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The scar on its face made it clear, a long slash running diagonally down from above its nose, adding a fierce and domineering aura to a Pok\u233?mon that is usually quite gentle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This aura even seemed to surpass Iris's grumpy Dragonite in the anime.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon hearing his words, the leader Dragonite nodded, its voice very deep: "Roar." (If you win, I'll work here like the other Dragonites.)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing this, D immediately understood.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Dragonite is very strong, so it needs him to prove his strength by defeating it in a Pok\u233?mon battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only then will this Dragonite acknowledge him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But D still couldn't figure out why Dragonite was doing this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It couldn't be just for Poffin and Pokeblock, right?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thinking this, D asked aloud.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And the leader Dragonite's answer was straightforward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wanted to become stronger! So it needed a human Trainer!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing this, D was shocked, quickly turning around to look around, only relaxing when he saw his own Dragonite hadn't returned yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He shook his head and said, "You can't say things like that recklessly. I can help you become stronger, but you don't need to consider me your Trainer, just consider me a boss!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The leader Dragonite didn't mind and didn't linger on titles for too long.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If I defeat you, will you stay and help me work?" D asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The leader Dragonite nodded, it was a very honorable Dragonite and would definitely keep its promise!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright." D nodded slightly. If this Dragonite joined, it would be beneficial for the future development of Dragonite Delivery.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for helping it become stronger\u8230? he would do his best to help later, whether through cooking or other methods.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thinking of this, D asked the final question.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Which of my Pok\u233?mon do you want to battle against?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Many of the ranch's Pok\u233?mon gathered around.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There were Koraidon, Cyclizar, Flutter Mane, Pawmot, Alcremie, Eevees, Ogerpon, along with Butterfree and Garganacl.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The leader Dragonite scanned these Pok\u233?mon and finally stopped on Koraidon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragon's Senses told it that this red Pok\u233?mon was the strongest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its aura, its gaze\u8230? all were honed through countless battles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Following the leader Dragonite's gaze, D looked at Koraidon, internally exclaiming, good grief, it chose a big boss!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Koraidon's strength is very strong." D reminded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, upon hearing this, the Dragonite's tone became even more determined.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wanted to battle the strongest Pok\u233?mon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Koraidon: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ahem, that's the only way, then." D looked at Koraidon and said, "Koraidon, I'll leave it to you!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Aaagh!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Koraidon stepped forward, staring down that wild Dragonite from a distance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D originally thought to let the opposing Dragonite strike first, but upon reconsideration, with its personality, this approach would likely be seen as disdain, a sign of disrespect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After some thought, D decided to let Koraidon battle seriously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once both Pok\u233?mon were ready, D spoke up to remind them, "Start now!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite gave its all, immediately spreading its wings and opening its mouth wide, the purple Dragon Type Energy quickly gathering within, transforming into a Twister that poured forth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dodge!" D calmly ordered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He knew well how fast Koraidon was when it gave its all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure enough, at his command, Koraidon's figure became a blur, dodging the incoming Twister, charging fiercely from the side at Dragonite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing its attack dodged, Dragonite quickly shut its mouth, its Dragon Wings vibrating fiercely, then it clenched its right fist, which crackled with electricity, heading straight for Koraidon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two Pok\u233?mon collided, and a powerful gust spread out from their center to the surroundings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the first clash, Koraidon held back slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite also did not retreat, just like its unyielding nature, at this close distance, Dragonite directly used its strongest move, Outrage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An intense purple light enveloped its body, a red glow flashed in Dragonite's eyes, and it began to unleash an unrestrained flurry of attacks towards Koraidon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Use Dragon Claw!" D commanded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Aagh." Koraidon responded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though the power of Outrage is immense, it has a very obvious flaw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That is, the Pok\u233?mon can't defend while attacking and will fall into confusion after Outrage ends!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Koraidon seized this flaw, unleashing a massive Dragon Claw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite's Outrage was directly interrupted, the powerful impact sent it flying, hitting the ground and losing its ability to battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two other Dragonites accompanying the leader looked at Koraidon in shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D stepped forward, checking the fallen Dragonite's condition, then asked his sister Indeedee, who had hurried over, to bring a bottle of Life Sheep Milk.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
During the wait, he looked at the two remaining Dragonites and asked, "Do you two also want to battle my Pok\u233?mon?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both Dragonites shook their heads, "Roar!" (We're with the boss, whatever the boss does, we do too!)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D was intrigued by this term, why did these three Dragonites seem like a gang?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He looked down at the unconscious Dragonite before him, reaching out to touch the scar on its face, and asked:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How did your boss get this scar on his face?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two underling Dragonites eagerly began recounting their boss's heroic deeds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roar!" (The boss got it fighting a Gyarados back in the day!)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roar!" (That Gyarados was really tough, and the boss put in a lot of effort to take it down, becoming the ruler of that sea area!)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roar!" (Though the boss looks fierce, the Pok\u233?mon there are all scared of him, but the boss is not a bad dragon, he never harms the Pok\u233?mon there!)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Evidently, these two Dragonites admired their leader immensely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They were even deliberately mimicking the fearsome expression of the boss Dragonite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
