Dragonite's eyes widened; it immediately landed in front of D, blocking the view of the three wild Dragonites.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Big brother Dragonite also noticed this famously foolish Dragonite on the island.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its gaze shifted from the human to this Dragonite, sharply sensing the hostility emanating from the latter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Big brother Dragonite stayed silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite also said nothing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two Dragonites stood on the grass, gazing at each other, and their faces showed serious expressions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ahem." Seeing D, D squeezed between the two Dragonites, blocking their view, then said to Dragonite: "Well, these three Dragonites are also here to apply for work at our ranch."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Work application? Dragonite was skeptical.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It knew the big brother Dragonite, understood its strength, and was aware of its unique pride.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such a Dragonite couldn't be attracted by Poffin, so why would it come to the ranch to work?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Aowoo?" Dragonite asked uncertainly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D patted Dragonite on the shoulder: "So, according to procedure, the three of them are yours to handle next. Take them to town, show them around, and arrange some work for them!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D wasn't wrong; these three Dragonites did come for work, but their goal wasn't Poffin\u8212?it was to become stronger.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D planned to pay these three Dragonites by helping them get stronger and informed Dragonite of this arrangement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite thought carefully about it; working for D to gain an opportunity to increase strength?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That seemed quite nice, actually, saving a lot of Poffin!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Realizing they weren't here to compete with it for trainers, Dragonite relaxed, happily nodded in agreement: "Aowoo~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go ahead then!" D said with a smile, patting its head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, Dragonite took the big brother Dragonite and the others to Porto Marinada Town, introducing them to the delivery process and the areas they would be responsible for.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Early next morning, D Ranch's delivery team gained three more Dragonites.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the eyes of Porto Marinada Town's residents, the Dragonites from D Ranch were all very gentle and kind-hearted, leading them to subconsciously believe all Dragonite Pokemon were like this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yet today, early in the morning, these townspeople realized they were completely wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
