Big brother Dragonite remained silent, placing the milk in its hand on the ground, before turning around and leaving.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Staring at the milk on the ground, the old lady snapped out of her panic.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Dragonite... came to deliver her milk?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
*\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While the Dragonites were out delivering, D stayed at the ranch waiting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only when all the Dragonites returned safely did he relax.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Seems like the delivery work of those three newly-joined Dragonites went quite smoothly."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D had worried their appearance would scare the townsfolk because these three Dragonites had expressions like bandits; if encountered on the road, passerby's first thought might be that the Dragonite was going to attack them!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it seemed everything was fine, and he hadn't received complaints from the townspeople.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now it was D's turn to fulfill his promise!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back at the ranch, the Dragonites landed on a patch of grass.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some were chatting with each other, some were sleeping soundly, and others were happily devouring their food.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially the two little Dragonite brothers accompanying the big brother Dragonite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Big brother Dragonite wasn't very interested in tasty Poffin, but its two brothers were different.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once they tasted the Poffin's flavor, they simply couldn't resist, fully immersing themselves in the world of Poffin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But big brother Dragonite was different.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had excellent self-control and pursued higher-level aims.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
D glanced over and then called big brother Dragonite into the living room.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} 
